graph LR
    OpenShell["OpenShell Gateway<br/>+ Supervisor + Sandbox"]

    %% Required external dependencies
    OpenShell -->|Sandbox CRD + controller| AgentSandbox["Kubernetes SIG Agent Sandbox<br/>agents.x-k8s.io v1beta1/v1alpha1"]
    OpenShell -->|user auth, JWKS| OIDC["OIDC IdP<br/>Keycloak 26.4.10 validated"]
    OpenShell -->|NetworkPolicy enforcement| CNI["OVN-Kubernetes CNI"]
    OpenShell -->|API server, TokenReview| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]

    %% Optional external dependencies
    OpenShell -.->|PKI, optional| CertManager["cert-manager"]
    OpenShell -.->|HA persistence| Postgres["PostgreSQL"]
    OpenShell -.->|credential driver| Vault["Vault / OpenBao"]
    OpenShell -.->|dynamic token grants| SPIRE["SPIFFE/SPIRE"]
    OpenShell -.->|GRPCRoute ingress| GatewayAPI["Gateway API impl<br/>Envoy Gateway"]
    OpenShell -.->|traces| OTLP["OTLP Collector"]

    %% Internal platform
    Dashboard["openshell-dashboard"] -->|gRPC/HTTP client| OpenShell
    Router["OpenShift Router<br/>Route passthrough"] -->|external access| OpenShell
    RHOAI["RHOAI platform<br/>coexistence, no operator mgmt"] -.-> OpenShell
    Prometheus["Prometheus"] -->|scrape 9090| OpenShell

    %% External services
    OpenShell -->|agent egress via supervisor| Providers["Inference / Model Providers"]

    %% Key libraries
    subgraph Libs["Key Rust libraries"]
        L1["tonic / axum / hyper / tokio"]
        L2["rustls 0.23 + aws-lc-rs 1.16"]
        L3["kube 0.99"]
        L4["sqlx 0.9"]
        L5["regorus 0.9 OPA"]
        L6["z3 vendored"]
        L7["jsonwebtoken 10 / russh 0.65"]
    end
    OpenShell --> Libs

    style OpenShell fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px
